stinct characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tense Boss Battles and Diverse Attack Patterns</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/boss_attack_type_640.gif?t=1747355300\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No two bosses are the same, and most will randomly use one of three special attack patterns, providing enjoyment even in repeated playthroughs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Growth Elements - Robots and Main Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/upgrade_unit_640.gif?t=1747355300\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your robot\u2019s stats and traits using in-game currency gained from gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also unlock and enhance weapon skills to see changes in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Growth Elements - Sub Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/upgrade_sub_weapon_640.gif?t=1747355300\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each sub weapon comes with two skill trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strengthen and level up your sub weapons to create your own unique weapon formation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Creative Gorae"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/d77ce5c4b766f78271c5c229ab0dc77c3781089a/header.jpg?t=1747355300","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Corei7-11<br>