47355300"}],"short_description":"&quot;Guardians Of Restoration&quot; is a top-down robot action game that combines action and bullet hell elements. Level up within a set time to enjoy thrilling battles against various bosses. Each boss randomly possesses one of three traits, ensuring a unique and exciting experience every time you play.","steam_appid":3092280,"support_info":{"email":"blackgoraegames.dev@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Japanese, Korean, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Portugal, Polish","type":"game","website":null}